{
"text": "The money$4,025,858 from political committees.Six cycles, reported to the FEC. Bob Smith has taken none of it.See the record ▸",
"href": "https://bobsmithforcongress.com/who-pays-him/"
},
{
"text": "The recordCarbajal says housing costs are out of control.He has had ten years. His casework page still says first term.See the record ▸",
"href": "https://bobsmithforcongress.com/ten-years/"
},
{
"text": "The voteCarbajal voted against banning congressional stock trading.Roll call 280. 232 members voted yes. He was not one of them.See the record ▸",
"href": "https://bobsmithforcongress.com/the-stock-trade/"
},
{
"text": "The voteThirty three days before the Thomas Fire, Carbajal voted no.H.R. 2936 sped up forest clearing. It passed 232 to 188. He voted no.See the record ▸",
"href": "https://bobsmithforcongress.com/before-the-fire/"
